# 4. HIGH-LEVEL SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

## 4.1 Architecture overview

MOMENT uses a modular monolith supported by managed infrastructure.

The Next.js application provides the user interface and trusted server-side application operations.

Supabase provides the authoritative PostgreSQL database, authentication, realtime delivery and approved storage capabilities.

A background processing component handles scheduled and asynchronous operations when required.

The architecture separates user-facing presentation from trusted business logic and data access.

